    "type": "game",
    "name": "Flock Party",
    "steam_appid": 2423860,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2423860/extras/2bce2205045e27cc1db6453c969869a3.webp?t=1697406219\" /></span><br>Ready to squawk and roll? In Flock Party, you take control of a bird by using the movement of your arms and head to flap, turn, glide, and dive. The intuitive flight mechanics are easy to learn, but challenging to master. You\u2019ll need to keep flapping your arms to maintain altitude, while tilting and turning to avoid obstacles. <br><br>Whether you\u2019re a seasoned VR gamer or a first-time flier, Flock Party is designed to be comfortable and fun for anyone to pick up and enjoy.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Unique flying mechanic controlled by your hands and head<br></li><li> Comfortable and exciting immersive flying experience <br></li><li> Single-player adventure mode featuring cutscenes and a storyline<br></li><li> Multiplayer mode with customizable match options and multiple different gameplay modes<br></li><li> 18 different colorful courses across six different biomes (with more to come!)<br></li><li> An infinite \u201cFly Forever\u201d mode that procedurally generates a course to test your skills and endurance<br></li><li> Customize the visual look of your bird</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2423860/extras/48c6c94d85f2ca5568c08e3def832d18.webp?t=1697406219\" /></span><br><br>Help guide your bird back to its wayward flock in Flock Party\u2019s single-player campaign. The campaign features 18 courses that weave through grassy meadows, steep canyons, menacing castles, towering mountains, dense jungles, and more. The environments become increasingly challenging to navigate as you progress through the courses, requiring you to use all your skills to make it to the finish line.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2423860/extras/c8fad606859329effee26f1378497518.poster.avif?t=1697406219\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2423860/extras/c8fad606859329effee26f1378497518.webm?t=1697406219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2423860/extras/c8fad606859329effee26f1378497518.mp4?t=1697406219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2423860/extras/07f00ba69d9c045a2aa4f441b69e05a0.webp?t=1697406219\" /></span><br><br>Why fly alone when you can fly with friends? Host private games or join a public match to compete against other birds to see who\u2019s the best flier in races of up to eight players. Matches can be customized to create the racing experience you want. In addition to traditional racing, you can face off against other players in a variety of different multiplayer modes, including \u201cEgg Hunt\u201d and \u201cLast Bird Flying,\u201d for endless bird-filled fun. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2423860/extras/2876e9ae8462d4707506b242acd72255.avif?t=1697406219\" /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2423860/extras/dcca2741a5630440aeadcdfe635c102b.webp?t=1697406219\" /></span><br><br>Make your bird stand out with a range of customization options. You can change the shape of its body, eyes, wings, beak, and feet, choose different feather patterns and color options, and add accessories like hats and glasses \u2013 the sky\u2019s the limit!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2423860/extras/201e485900841ca1883038c01fe168d6.poster.avif?t=1697406219\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2423860/extras/201e485900841ca1883038c01fe168d6.webm?t=1697406219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2423860/extras/0433a950240048c5db9fab5d06dc5fbf.poster.avif?t=1697406219\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2423860/extras/0433a950240048c5db9fab5d06dc5fbf.webm?t=1697406219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2423860/extras/52fa0c4c1d0169ea99dab53c6ff6dae7.poster.avif?t=1697406219\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2423860/extras/52fa0c4c1d0169ea99dab53c6ff6dae7.webm?t=1697406219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>",
